{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.2:0.4"], "en": "The Stanzas of the Elder Mahākoṭṭhika:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.2:1.1"], "en": "“Peaceful, restrained,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.2:1.2"], "en": "measured in speech, and unagitated;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.2:1.3"], "en": "“He shakes off evil states,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.2:1.4"], "en": "as the wind shakes off the leaves of a tree.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.2:1.5"], "en": "Thus indeed did the venerable elder Mahākoṭṭhita speak this verse.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"}
